# ---- weekly scan reports ----
# Generated per run. Not committed: the repository is public, and a committed
# history of scan reports publishes our detection cadence and coverage to the
# operators being tracked. CI keeps them as 90-day build artefacts, and the
# durable record is bp_discovery_runs in Supabase.
docs/scans/

